        <description>Fiddle bridge wire schema 2: typed Off (On+64) and revision beacon on KS126/KS127. Note durations pinned to 100% (written lengths). Pending Dorico host acceptance. Bowed orchestral strings: 33 conduits, 25 bases, 87 add-ons. Specification SHA256: 33aae61494f2fd9e923e1d827f0b7dad26ea5256fd2b03482a4c9a3a71d7daaf</description>
